https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/99f88f15c5febbca2d13b5b5fda27b844153bf1a/server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/cluster/routing/allocation/decider/ThrottlingAllocationDecider.java#L149-L169

@czjxy881 it looks from your colour scheme that you're using IntelliJ. If so, you may like to know that you can select some code and select 'Open in Github' from the context menu to get a URL that links to code, rather than using a screenshot.

@elastic/es-distributed I'm marking this as adoptme.
